scope live-stream-demo
  source local-collaboration

question what-should-thoughtml-build-next
  What should ThoughtML build next?
  expects option
  status open

observation live-streaming-is-now-working
  ThoughtML can host a live reasoning view from the editing computer.

claim streaming-makes-agent-work-visible
  Streaming makes an autonomous agent's evolving reasoning visible to a human.

observation administrator-is-watching-the-session-live
  The administrator opened the stream and began watching the agent's work live.

observation agent-is-still-working
  The agent is still working and has not reached a final decision yet.

claim live-progress-is-better-than-a-final-report
  Live progress gives the administrator a chance to intervene before the final report.

question should-the-agent-pause-for-review
  Should the agent pause for human review before choosing the next feature?
  expects option
  status open

outcome supervisor-can-see-the-next-turn
  The supervisor can see the next turn of reasoning as soon as it is written.

option improve-multi-file-editing
  Improve the multi-file editing experience.

option deepen-live-collaboration
  Deepen the live collaboration experience.

goal make-agent-reasoning-easy-to-supervise
  Make long-running agent reasoning easy for a human to supervise.

link live-streaming-is-now-working supports streaming-makes-agent-work-visible
link administrator-is-watching-the-session-live supports streaming-makes-agent-work-visible
link streaming-makes-agent-work-visible supports make-agent-reasoning-easy-to-supervise
